Patched again, and this one wasn't surprising given that collapsing sparse cells in the SX-2 statistic can be complicated.

Also, if you notice any more issues would you mind opening a issues ticket on Github instead of posting it to the forum? That should save others from receiving bug report emails, and keeps the forum more about discussion and questions. Cheers.

Phil

